# sqlx embeds migration SQL at compile time and content-hashes the raw bytes
# (including line endings) into _sqlx_migrations. Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise produce CRLF files and different
# checksums from CI/Linux builds, making databases opened by one build
# unusable by the other (data_directory.database_migration_failed).
src-tauri/migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
